      "name": "dsh-preset-tuning",
      "title": {
        "en": "Preset Tuning",
        "zh": "注入筛选"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Filter tools and hide skills per agent preset. Hidden tool schemas leave the context entirely; hidden skills shadow out of the catalog while the plugin that provides them keeps running. Rules are applied through a Host service, so a change reaches a running session without a restart.",
        "zh": "按 agent preset 过滤工具、隐藏技能。被隐藏的工具 schema 完全退出上下文；被隐藏的技能从目录里消失，而提供它的插件照常运行。规则经 Host 服务下发，改完连当前会话都立刻生效，不需要重启。"
      },
      "author": "Wizard_Aox",
